{
  "_source": "Marker-to-lineage mapping for a typical human bone marrow CODEX / PhenoCycler panel. The choice of markers follows the published human bone marrow CODEX atlases (for example Bandyopadhyay et al., 2024, Cell, https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2024.04.013) in spirit; this list is a generic panel and is not claimed to be any study's exact antibody list. Column names in a real table are matched case-insensitively against the marker name and its aliases.",
  "_scoring": "Per cell: arcsinh(intensity / 5), then z-score per marker across cells; lineage score = mean of positive markers minus mean of negative markers; the cell takes the argmax lineage. This mirrors the marker-score argmax used for the RNA lineage labels so the two labelings are comparable.",
